B.brJ=s(["1. Locate the GFCI outlet (with TEST and RESET buttons) in the bathroom, kitchen, garage, or basement.","2. Unplug hair dryers, space heaters, or small appliances from the dead outlets.",'3. Press the middle "RESET" button firmly until you hear a click.',"4. Check the unit breaker panel for any switch sitting halfway between ON and OFF; flip it fully OFF then back ON."],t.s)
B.atD=new A.u0("gfci_outlet","No Power in Bathroom / Kitchen / Exterior Outlet",B.brJ,"GFCI outlet or breaker reset restored power \xe2\u20ac\u201d no electrician call needed!")
B.bFc=s(["1. Turn the wall switch OFF immediately and never put your hand inside the disposal.","2. Look underneath the sink at the bottom of the disposal unit and press the small red overload RESET button.",'3. If the unit hums, insert a 1/4" Allen hex key into the center bottom hole and crank back and forth to free the flywheel.',"4. Run cold water and test the switch again."],t.s)
