B.bGr=s(["1. A single chirp every 30\xe2\u20ac\u201c60 seconds indicates a low 9V or AA backup battery (or end-of-life sensor).","2. Twist the detector counter-clockwise off its ceiling bracket, swap in a fresh alkaline battery, and hold the HUSH/TEST button for 5 seconds.","3. WARNING: If the CO alarm sounds 4 rapid beeps continuously, evacuate immediately and call emergency services."],t.s)
